      "text": "3512092"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "SurroundingArea",
      "text": "A stay at Admiral Hotel at Park Avenue places you in the heart of London, within a 10-minute walk of Hyde Park and Kensington Gardens.  This bed \u0026 breakfast is 0.8 mi (1.2 km) from Marble Arch and 0.5 mi (0.8 km) from Paddington Central."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RoomTypes",
      "text": "Make yourself at home in one of the 22 guestrooms featuring refrigerators and flat-screen televisions. Complimentary wireless internet access keeps you connected, and digital programming is available for your entertainment. Private bathrooms with bathtubs or showers feature complimentary toiletries and hair dryers. Conveniences include phones, as well as desks and coffee/tea makers."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PropertyInformation",
      "text": "Make use of convenient amenities such as complimentary wireless internet access, concierge services, and a fireplace in the lobby. If you\u0027re planning a day at a nearby theme park, you can hop on the shuttle (surcharge)."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "AreaActivities",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003EHyde Park - 0.5 km / 0.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Kensington Gardens - 0.6 km / 0.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Paddington Central - 0.8 km / 0.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Marble Arch - 1.2 km / 0.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Park Lane - 1.3 km / 0.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Baker Street - 1.4 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Queensway - 1.5 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Selfridges - 1.5 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Madame Tussauds Wax Museum - 1.6 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Sherlock Holmes Museum - 1.6 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Kensington High Street - 1.7 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Kensington Palace - 1.7 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Regent\u0027s Park - 1.8 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Royal Albert Hall - 1.8 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Marylebone High Street - 1.9 km / 1.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003ELondon City Airport (LCY) - 18.1 km / 11.2 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Heathrow Airport (LHR) - 27.9 km / 17.3 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Gatwick Airport (LGW) - 95.6 km / 59.4 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Luton Airport (LTN) - 50.6 km / 31.4 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Farnborough (FAB) - 62.7 km / 39 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe preferred airport for Admiral Hotel at Park Avenue is Heathrow Airport (LHR). \u003C/p\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PoliciesDisclaimers",
      "text": "\u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EExtra-person charges may apply and vary depending on property policy\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGovernment-issued photo identification and a credit card, debit card, or cash deposit may be required at check-in for incidental charges\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpecial requests are subject to availability upon check-in and may incur additional charges; special requests cannot be guaranteed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property accepts credit cards and cash\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafety features at this property include a fire extinguisher, a security system, and a first aid kit\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E \u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EContactless check-out is available.\u003C/li\u003E \u003C/ul\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "DiningFacilities",
      "text": "At Admiral Hotel at Park Avenue, enjoy a satisfying meal at the restaurant. Quench your thirst with your favorite drink at the bar/lounge. A complimentary English breakfast is served daily from 7:30 AM to 9:30 AM."
    }
  ],
